  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d29874e3b4e59e549ab8ca779e34be5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Goop_0-Discovers human in Goop Galaxy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - Why are you here? This course was discontinued by the Caddi long before they
    disappeared.
  - Their reason is a mystery, but it was rumoured that a local alien group forced
    them out through technology that harnessed the forces of dark matter.
  - "Now, dark matter plagues the planets in this galaxy. Your golf ball will stick
    to those infected planets. I\u2019m getting out of here; this place gives me
    the creeps."
